  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "林仔邊ê二二八公園"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b>作者：顧邦猷</b><br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhvv23-SEnIj-MslPzTGkEfxKbgL5pWeFFu0zzdAevJIvNEL1SPme3i7lT5EPuGoxoPk69AFXFE4TajtOsmngBGl6MezIZ4H3CMEtCsxjjDdoriSHEpQxJHMfKfvBWM_4krCprAyIE9mHDz/s1600/%25E7%25B4%2580%25E5%25BF%25B5%25E7%25A2%259101.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1600\" data-original-width=\"900\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhvv23-SEnIj-MslPzTGkEfxKbgL5pWeFFu0zzdAevJIvNEL1SPme3i7lT5EPuGoxoPk69AFXFE4TajtOsmngBGl6MezIZ4H3CMEtCsxjjDdoriSHEpQxJHMfKfvBWM_4krCprAyIE9mHDz/s640/%25E7%25B4%2580%25E5%25BF%25B5%25E7%25A2%259101.jpg\" width=\"360\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n林仔邊有二二八公園，公園內有紀念碑。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n結婚了後，kap牽手tńg去後頭厝，伊講：tshuā你去看紀念碑。原來tī林仔邊護岸公園尾溜，經過一tsat天橋，就是二二八公園，koh行--幾-分-鐘-仔，ē看著涼亭仔附近一个親像英文「X」ê碑。我tsiah知影——林仔邊有二二八事件ê受害者。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n詳細看，是兩支彎khiau ê白鐵仔管，伊ê意象是：beh收束ê空喙，遠遠看tsiah親像「X」；碑文是大理石刻--ê，寫阮朝日kap鄭清福先生等人tī hit時tsūn受難，日頭下猶原金siak-siak。看--起-來，真少人來tsia散步，m̄-koh有人piànn掃，環境真清幽。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n牽手講：阮朝日先生有紀念館，lán來去參觀。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhf0joKJJFvju5KyaA4Zmm_pCjAP17Mlcw1onV4vz4qiRD2TxYtPA0jSvuq5DXWzQzvQzb-Ldo9fXKSc-ra3t8HkKVuHwXwZRykBR-XrcpnP3_rZ04PXqExCiD8V3Cit7Zw1PudMFJkyTIY/s1600/%25E7%25B4%2580%25E5%25BF%25B5%25E7%25A2%259102.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1600\" data-original-width=\"900\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhf0joKJJFvju5KyaA4Zmm_pCjAP17Mlcw1onV4vz4qiRD2TxYtPA0jSvuq5DXWzQzvQzb-Ldo9fXKSc-ra3t8HkKVuHwXwZRykBR-XrcpnP3_rZ04PXqExCiD8V3Cit7Zw1PudMFJkyTIY/s640/%25E7%25B4%2580%25E5%25BF%25B5%25E7%25A2%259102.jpg\" width=\"360\" /></a>Hit年，是陳水扁總統連任，選輸ê人見笑tńg受氣，大聲huah：「選舉無效！」Iáu有一个人，頭真光，講伊beh禁食，講話是真tshia-iānn。Gún來到阮朝日紀念館，無先注文，拄好有開，原來是阮美姝女士tī tsia看顧，解sueh阮朝日先生ê事蹟。阮--先-生是大企業家，hit時是《台灣新生報》ê總經理，m̄-koh 3月初1因為重感冒請假tī厝，十外工lóng無出門，完全無參與任何抗爭活動iah是會議，3月12 suah hōo人掠--去，下落不明，無緣無故家破人亡。阮女士m̄甘願tsit个事件就án-ne無聲無sueh，長年收集史料，堅持成立紀念館。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nHit時電視tng-leh播送頭真光ê人講：伊代表台灣人民，lim落tsit杯豆奶。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nGún三人隨接：「Siáng beh hōo你代表！」</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTuì hit工開始，gún tsiânn無愛lim豆奶。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTse是十外冬前ê代誌，我一直記tī心內。如今，阮女士tī 2016年看著koh一擺政黨輪替，伊離開ê時，是m̄是面帶笑容，去陪伴阮朝日先生？Tsit-má雖然無法度koh去紀念館，iáu有紀念碑thang看。今年新正tńg來林仔邊，牽手講：lán來去整理紀念碑。真久無來tsia，碑座ê石枋已經pit--去，一半以上消失；草仔tī「X」下跤鑽--出-來，性命力真giám-ngē；大理石面用桌布拭--過，照常金siak-siak。Gún挽草拭碑，結束了後，tī塗跤看著一粒石頭，模樣親像台灣，將伊囥tī碑前，挽一束tshiah查某花tī石頭頂，兩人雙手合十，祝願往生kap在生ê人lóng平安sūn-sī。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n聽講以前huah『反攻大陸』ê hit陣人，tsit-má想beh kap中國簽和平協議。我kan-na希望：m̄-thang koh有親像二二八事件tsit款ê代誌發生。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n離開ê時，我又koh想起阮美姝女士，所以，寫tsit篇文章來紀念。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhT0QLFfxj_WDrwmd5NukIrhaMb1GjgFdY9yteoANaY05YXenrWdwx5uFYprtfT28iOHF9-3l8bqisADwL5Jg0GQHZr_d4KWf0IX5aFts7ok7C0vZIHfHFfSfYsgoEmrOpSyCb5m3xz_b3-/s1600/%25E7%25B4%2580%25E5%25BF%25B5%25E7%25A2%259103.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"900\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhT0QLFfxj_WDrwmd5NukIrhaMb1GjgFdY9yteoANaY05YXenrWdwx5uFYprtfT28iOHF9-3l8bqisADwL5Jg0GQHZr_d4KWf0IX5aFts7ok7C0vZIHfHFfSfYsgoEmrOpSyCb5m3xz_b3-/s640/%25E7%25B4%2580%25E5%25BF%25B5%25E7%25A2%259103.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>#光景bóng uē&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報305期，2019年8月出刊。</b></span><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br />\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br /></div>\n"
